{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ModelsOfQous.ReebDecomposition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ModelsOfQous.ReebDecomposition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Glossary","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.NatTrans","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.ExteriorAlgebra.Basic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.isPurelyHorizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.isPurelyHorizontal","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L66-L69","doc":"A form is **purely horizontal** iff its vertical component vanishes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.decomp","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Decomposition identity: `total = horizontal + vertical`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.vertical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.vertical","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Vertical component `α_V = θ ∧ ι_ξ α`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.horizontal","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Horizontal component `α_H` satisfying `ι_ξ α_H = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.total","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The total form (abstract representative).\n\nReal-valued. This structure and the two components below were `M → R_q`\nwhere the library copy (`lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/Particles.lean:18`)\nhas `ℝ`. The docstring above settles it: the decomposition\n`α = α_H + θ ∧ ι_ξ α` is written with the contact form `θ` and the\ninterior product `ι_ξ`, which are real differential-geometric operations\non a CR manifold — the same reason `CRManifoldData.contactForm` is `ℝ`.\nBean `qou-u87j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition","kind":"structure","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L41-L64","doc":"**Reeb decomposition** of a differential form on a CR manifold.\n\nEvery `k`-form `α` decomposes as `α = α_H + θ ∧ ι_ξ α` where\n`α_H` is the horizontal component and `θ ∧ ι_ξ α` is the vertical\ncomponent.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:reeb-decomposition}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:reeb-decomposition","label":"ex:reeb-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_param","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.R_q","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0}]}